    Elements of type $(1,21,6,14)$ form a normal subgroup $H$ of index $8$ in $\Gamma^{\prime\prime}$, with each type of elements form a coset in $\Gamma^{\prime\prime}$ with repect to this subgroup $H$. Moreover, $\Gamma^{\prime \prime}/H \cong (\ZZ/2\ZZ)^{\oplus3}$. 
