$$
\text{ front } : \sigma_{i+1} = \sigma_{i+1} \sigma_{i+1} \sigma_{i+1}^{-1}, \qquad \text{ back } : \sigma_i^{-1} \sigma_{i+1}^{-1}= \sigma_{i+1}^{-1} \sigma_{i+1} \sigma_i^{-1} \sigma_{i+1}^{-1}, 
