with the adjacent strand of double points (the pink strand in Figure~\ref{fig:ProofMoves}(a)): expand 
$\X^{1, m-1}_{m, 2m}= \X^{1,m-1}_m \X^{2,m}_{m+1, 2m}$ by~\eqref{eq:expandX} and then replace
$\I^1_{ m-1} \X^{1, m-1}_m = \I^1_{m}$ by~\eqref{eq:split-one} to get 
