\X^{4,m}_{m+1, 2m}   \I^3_{ m+3} \I^2_{ m+2} \I^1_{ m+1}=_\d \dots =_\d \\
& \TN   \I^{m+1}_{ 2m-1}\I^1_{ m}   \X^{m-2,m}_{m+1, 2m}    \I^{m-3}_{ 2m-3} \dots \I^2_{m+2} \I^1_{ m+1}.
\end{split}
\end{equation*}
The resulting diagram is in~Figure\ref{fig:ProofMoves}(b). The multipoints 
