$$
\TN \I^1_{ m} \I^{m+1}_{ 2m-1}  \X^{m-2,m}_{m+1, 2m}    \I^{m-3}_{ 2m-3} \dots \I^2_{ m+2} \I^1_{ m+1}
$$
and use~\eqref{eq:move-multipt-tang} to slide $\I_{1, m}$ down past the tangency nest to get 
