   \Delta_{1,m} \Delta_{m+1, 2m}^{-1} \TN \I^{m+1}_{2m}    \I^{m+1}_{ 2m-1}  \X^{m-2,m}_{m+1, 2m}    \I^{m-3}_{ 2m-3} \dots \I^2_{ m+2} \I^1_{ m+1},
