$$
\I^{m+1}_{ 2m}    \I^{m+1}_{ 2m-1} =_\d  \I^{m+2}_{ 2m} \X^{m+1}_{m+2, 2m} \I^{m+1}_{ 2m-1}  =_\d \I^{m+2}_{ 2m}    \I^{m+1}_{ 2m}. 
